# Requiem of Sin (battlefield.requiem_of_sin#areas, Boneyard Gully): Area 2 (option 98): kill the Shikarees +6, then a
# trigger of the armoury crate +90 (its loot to main's inventory: three items): event 32001 (2,1800,0,37,8,6). Then the
# Letter from Shikaree Y again and area 3 (option 99, update 2,6,106): kill +12, trigger the crate +96 (its loot to
# main's inventory: two items): event 32001 (3,37,1,37,8,6). Each finish changes nothing: the quest's 32001
# (OtherAreas/RequiemOfSin.cs) completes it only when accepted with battlefieldWin set to the battlefield, and no char
# here has the quest accepted (the quest flows prove the completion).
lists BoneyardGully/_081/onTrigger BoneyardGully/onEventUpdate/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32001
